# ===== Generated calibration corpora (local only, never commit) =====
# Splice test sets are generated locally from CC-BY sources.
# They are large (~150 JPEG files) and fully reproducible via build_splice_corpus.py.
models/splice_calibration_150/
models/splice_calibration_*/
# Wikimedia Commons mined corpus (89 MB of CC-BY/CC0/PD JPEGs, reproducible
# via scripts/mine_wikimedia_composites.py). Manifest is also ignored — it
# contains absolute filesystem paths and is regenerated on each run.
models/splice_wikimedia_v1/
# Platform-forwarded augmentation corpus (backlog #16, ~4 GB on USB drive).
# Fully reproducible via scripts/augment_corpus_platform_forwarded.py.
# Lives on external USB, not in the repo.
training_platform_forwarded/
# Manifest JSON is large (~270k lines), contains absolute filesystem paths
# that vary per-machine, and is regenerated on each augmentation run.
models/platform_augmentation_manifest.json
